                  "id": "levelled_description_b7ecb6b2ea90",
                  "level": {
                    "value": 2
                  },
                  "description": {
                    "value": "Your training has prepared you to recognize most undead on sight. You become trained in two Lore skills, each about a specific type of undead, or become an expert if you were already trained. You gain the Slayer's Identification free action.\n\n**Slayer's Identification**\n\n- **Activate:** Free Action\n- **Trigger:** You roll initiative and can observe a creature you know is undead\n\nYou attempt to Recall Knowledge to identify the undead creature with a +1 circumstance bonus. If you're a master in the skill you're using to Recall Knowledge, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus instead."
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
